{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114082247729-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114083300\"/><p>觀塘游泳池有人遇溺。</p><p>觀塘游泳池有人遇溺。今日(14日)早上8時10分，一名女子在觀塘泳池游泳期間懷疑遇溺，在場人士發現立即將女子救回岸上並施行急救。救護車接報到場將昏迷事主送院搶救，其遇溺原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.047467+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:22:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:47.666466+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:33.710179+00:00","content_hash":"3ceac1b17cca573991d8789175c5d75d1c013d8351b486cce73b40cea437778c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}